    "content": "Skip to content Refer a Friend Refer More. Earn More. Why not let your friends know how AWESOME of a time you had learning at 3RI Technologies ? Refer your friends below: Fill in the below details to refer. Name Phone Number Freinds Name Friends Phone Number I have read and agree to the Terms and conditions of the referral program. For Referrer to be eligible for the offer, Referee Should enroll with 3RI Technologies within one month of a generation of the referral code. Send What Your Friends Get BETTER DISCOUNT Referred admissions get better discount. COURSE COMPLETION CERTIFICATION Get Certification once course completed PRIORITY ACCESS TO COURSES For referred admissions get priority access to courses Our Gift Vouchers Refer A Friends's FAQ's What benefits or rewards will the referrer receive? On every Successful referral, the referrer will get an Amazon, Paytm, Swiggy, and Starbucks gift voucher (or Similar) worth Rs. 1000. What information is required to be provided by the referrer while referring? While referring, the referrer is required to provide their own name and contact number, along with the name, address, contact details of the referee. When will the referrer be rewarded? Referrer will be rewarded after the referee will register successfully for a course with 3RI Technologies. What are the eligibility criteria for the referral program? The referree should be a student of 3RI Technologies. Can I refer multiple friends? Yes, You can refer multiple friends. Is there a time limit for referrals? No, there is no time limit for referrals. 3RI Technologies Learn the way industry wants it… Twitter Facebook-f Youtube Linkedin Instagram Whatsapp +91-830 810 3366 +91-962 386 8215 [email protected] Get Free Career Counseling Our expert career counsellor will call you within 30 min* Name Email Phone Number Select Course Select Course Mastering in Data Science Mastering in Data Analytics Mastering in AWS DevOps Mastering in GenAI & AgenticAI Java Full Stack Python Full Stack MERN Stack - React JS Mastering in Software Testing AWS DevOps AWS with DevOps React JS Selenium PowerBI Salesforce Azure TOSCA Playwright Cybersecurity I authorize 3RI Technologies team to communicate me via Email, SMS, WhatsApp and Call. It will override the registry on DND/NDNC. Send Upskill to Advance Your IT Career Personalized upskilling roadmap in a 15 – minute expert call 15+ Years Legacy in IT Training Trusted by 22,000+ Learners Placement & Career Guidance Support NASSCOM FutureSkills Prime University & Industry Recognized Programs Get Your Free Career Call Full Name Mobile Number Email Address Get My Free Career Call No spam | One call only | Free resume review after your call",
